UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Course Description</h4><p>A career in food and the culinary arts is your destiny if you have a love of making people happy with food, see yourself as a team player, and love to explore and create in a fast-paced dynamic kitchen environment.</p><p>Learn the fundamentals of food preparation and cooking skills and applying and practicing them across:</p><ul><li>A range of appetisers and salads</li><li>Poultry and game</li><li>Seafood and meat</li><li>A variety of hot and cold desserts,</li><li>Cakes and yeast goods</li></ul><p>You will also master the basics such as:</p><ul><li>Stocks, sauces and soups</li><li>Vegan and vegetarian dishes</li><li>Egg and pasta dishes.</li></ul><p>Learn practical skills too, such as food costs, effective communication and time management and have the opportunity to demonstrate these skills during live service periods.</p><p>View The Gordon''s <a href="/getmedia/f919541a-fb27-4946-a651-71157323a506/10530-Cookery-A4-Student-Info-Sheet-2024.pdf">Uniform and Toolkit requirements here</a>.</p>',
